"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\">Fireball</a> once until next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Draconic_Prowess:_Fire\"> Condition: Draconic Prowess: Fire </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Prowess:_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Draconic Prowess: Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Prowess: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Prowess:_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Draconic Prowess: Fire (Condition)\">Draconic Prowess: Fire</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on Intimidation and Persuasion <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">checks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage, and can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/25px-Fireball_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/38px-Fireball_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/50px-Fireball_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fireball\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/25px-Fireball_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\">Fireball</a> once until its next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> and later in <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> in exchange for <a href=\"/wiki/Brass_Dragonborn\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Brass Dragonborn\">brass</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gold_Dragonborn\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold Dragonborn\">gold</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Dragonborn\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Red Dragonborn\">red</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Dragonborn\" title=\"Dragonborn\">dragonborn</a> blood\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Araj's elixirs function independently of other elixirs, stacking with them and each other.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203300\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2450/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43602/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9863/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1202913/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.476      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   62.476      1 -total\n 42.55%   26.585      9 Template:Icon_text\n 37.96%   23.714     25 Template:Trim\n 17.93%   11.201      3 Template:Uid\n 17.60%   10.997      1 Template:Condition\n 14.03%  